cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EukBinMiner, please cite this software."
title: "EukBinMiner"
type: software
version: 0.1.4
date-released: 2026-11-08
authors:
  - family-names: "Contributors"
    given-names: "EukBinMiner"
abstract: >-
  A command-line workflow that runs multiple eukaryotic metagenomic binners,
  evaluates bins with EukCC and/or BUSCO, and selects non-redundant bins using
  within-sample cross-binner contig overlap.
repository-code: "https://github.com/WeStrainGroup/EukBinMiner"
